Implemented per-Stage Agent concurrency.

Changed:
- `apps/backend/lib/config.ml`: parses optional `stageAgents.stages[].maxConcurrentAgents`.
- `apps/backend/lib/orchestrator.ml`: enforces per-stage capacity while keeping `agent.maxConcurrentAgents` as the global hard cap; captures the selected Stage Agent before `startStatus` transitions.
- `apps/backend/lib/runtime_state.ml`: exposes selected stage identity on running rows.
- `apps/backend/test/test_backend.ml`: added parsing coverage and an Ordered Queue test proving a full stage does not block later stages with capacity.

